jpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-25T13:36:42.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667955:1","title":"南洋理工联合南信大提出ProtoCast：仅400余万参数，攻克局部多变量天气演化建模难题","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667955&idx=1&sn=a3643d30181a8fc0adca201f44e84562&chksm=97bacf9715ab7f271e1949ec004495320212b10a1ff1ca321778ce0026bf9075edbf38129c70&scene=126&sessionid=1795635100#rd","description":"气象预报可解释新范式","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWibQzArojq57kY5h5icy2gFqEs864udSRiapZf3sjUG3NOvia9UfzwdZDFexN5YBTzZnKeFVoOm4zH9TDIes5BRbhI6nvMkKkKOGWI%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T15:54:00.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667954:1","title":"NeurIPS 2026 | 北航联合清华AIR、滴滴等提出AutoVLA-D：解耦离散动作与连续轨迹，自动驾驶闭环PDMS达92.0","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667954&idx=1&sn=20bcebea3632bee98c116db34f2991d7&chksm=97a98b14b1a6367717949b1a6be878cf59e163a65fb7af7feb3a5e9ee2d484827519e1665c23&scene=126&sessionid=1795635100#rd","description":"离散引路，连续落笔","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGWicA8YmrtKic3zqUxObuBWSFaakCXebCNL9aOHM0aIQrAfRepL7icRg6UVlKBU3aTUxE8wB11gTrJibEkmRYx3uIs5ykLcMrBtp3d4%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-24T14:13:17.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667918:1","title":"北大联合腾讯混元等开源MovieRoll","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667918&idx=1&sn=deb74c00e2da204de48877305b70f970&chksm=9748784da614e6122986e309d6e251ac0e02ad73865a5305868ea06855a1295d529f57ec4d04&scene=126&sessionid=1795635100#rd","description":"北大、腾讯混元和港科大开源了 MovieRoll，专门解决 AI 长视频越往后越崩的问题。\n\n以前做流式视频，模型自己接着往下画时，小错会越滚越大。画面容易变色、变形甚至停住；全存历史又爆显存，只留最近几秒又会忘掉开头的人和景。\n\n他们给这套流程上了三道保险：\n\n窗口一起修：不再一块块单独算，而是让相邻几段互相参考着去噪。\n分层省缓存：浅层网络保留全局记忆，深层只记开头锚点和最近动作。显存最高省了 78%，延迟也砍了一半多。\n蒸馏加退火：把生成步骤压到 5 步，推理时引导强度慢慢降下来，减少最后几步的乱抖。\n\n实测里，60 秒单镜头和多事件切换都拿了最高分。不过目前生成 60 秒视频要两分半，离实时互动还差一截。\n\n代码已经开源，想折腾长视频生成的可以上手试试。","content":"<p>北大、腾讯混元和港科大开源了 MovieRoll，专门解决 AI 长视频越往后越崩的问题。<br /><br />以前做流式视频，模型自己接着往下画时，小错会越滚越大。画面容易变色、变形甚至停住；全存历史又爆显存，只留最近几秒又会忘掉开头的人和景。<br /><br />他们给这套流程上了三道保险：<br /><br />窗口一起修：不再一块块单独算，而是让相邻几段互相参考着去噪。<br />分层省缓存：浅层网络保留全局记忆，深层只记开头锚点和最近动作。显存最高省了 78%，延迟也砍了一半多。<br />蒸馏加退火：把生成步骤压到 5 步，推理时引导强度慢慢降下来，减少最后几步的乱抖。<br /><br />实测里，60 秒单镜头和多事件切换都拿了最高分。不过目前生成 60 秒视频要两分半，离实时互动还差一截。<br /><br />代码已经开源，想折腾长视频生成的可以上手试试。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW9l7gmwH7EGuzwkHTyY0hgbkZsppDGQ3oiaTYe4emvY7GdCtdibIzZV5lnGMVPicZMIa7u2aHC2f5zibeRcq4ibtiavRNyubacWKnB7o%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FP9MWBRYIGW8pDElOBS6iaKjxzgISOrkg2gZWWKga1NNWR51QUnuibNSTZL8Pdfpadh0Y00nEHwMmYbvNjQBhCacw87ENOOicXInQiasgqmZFB1c%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FP9MWBRYIGWibxgj9IyVib7WiaibhZy7fE6OiaicrYTkCYU3ILo2Dh6UpiahABjgsrF5auwmMTdjms2Dia2fe83aPV11BugwwDsLrpqv6dgzIiaWteEZw%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW9TW3R39VhBLsktJqoFLqicLzWibibacQHoVp7TY6Zb13JOPkDiaEibiaprXYkXdWia97GeI4RURicymlHb3IYMicFk6Jx5UedOiblPkvEWk%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW9l7gmwH7EGuzwkHTyY0hgbkZsppDGQ3oiaTYe4emvY7GdCtdibIzZV5lnGMVPicZMIa7u2aHC2f5zibeRcq4ibtiavRNyubacWKnB7o%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","images":["http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW9l7gmwH7EGuzwkHTyY0hgbkZsppDGQ3oiaTYe4emvY7GdCtdibIzZV5lnGMVPicZMIa7u2aHC2f5zibeRcq4ibtiavRNyubacWKnB7o%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_gif%2FP9MWBRYIGW8pDElOBS6iaKjxzgISOrkg2gZWWKga1NNWR51QUnuibNSTZL8Pdfpadh0Y00nEHwMmYbvNjQBhCacw87ENOOicXInQiasgqmZFB1c%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_gif%2FP9MWBRYIGWibxgj9IyVib7WiaibhZy7fE6OiaicrYTkCYU3ILo2Dh6UpiahABjgsrF5auwmMTdjms2Dia2fe83aPV11BugwwDsLrpqv6dgzIiaWteEZw%2F0","http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_png%2FP9MWBRYIGW9TW3R39VhBLsktJqoFLqicLzWibibacQHoVp7TY6Zb13JOPkDiaEibiaprXYkXdWia97GeI4RURicymlHb3IYMicFk6Jx5UedOiblPkvEWk%2F0"],"type":"gallery","published":"2026-11-24T04:19:04.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ%3D%3D:2247667654:1","title":"直接在像素上生成！PixVid将预训练Latent视","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzIwMTE1NjQxMQ==&mid=2247667654&idx=1&sn=fdbb240aaa24e83d332ba68c591cd1ca&chksm=97ffa205d0c397af1627389774ec033b4ca5f9cd1e3f39b07c36830534083fefa66a2ed2d7b6&scene=126&sessionid=1795635100#rd","description":"主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。\n\n分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。\n\nRoblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。\n\n效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。\n\n代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。","content":"<p>主流视频模型一直靠压缩画面省算力，现在这套玩法碰上高清和实时交互，开始露底了。<br /><br />分辨率一高，计算量暴涨；多帧压成一个特征，高速运动就容易变形；做交互还得攒够一组指令才动，延迟根本降不下来。<br /><br />Roblox 牵头的 PixVid 换了个思路：把现成模型直接拉回逐像素生成。它不用从头学，只改输入输出、重训一小块，64 张 B200 跑四千小时就收敛了。<br /><br />效果挺直观。画质追平甚至反超原模型；升到 960p，算力只涨 17%；高速运动编辑保留率冲到 98%，背景轮廓严丝合缝。交互延迟从近半秒压到 34 毫秒，按键下一帧就有反应，比原来快了 14 倍。<br /><br />代码还没开源，但路已经亮出来了——预训练模型能当先验用，没必要死守 VAE 那套压缩。</p>\n<img src=\"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FP9MWBRYIGW8t6ibr5JG56yUn9GaJibKR5UUic4d5n5tsyeak97gNhYZV3LTY1HGickd6nmjXerePt51BkM9mOW8niaUhTMnjtVyJ0ORjmGMich3jQ%2F0\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" />\n<img src=\"http: